  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation of Biodiv in China in light of Climate Change (inception)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This pre-project is preparing for a main project (2020-2022) with the aim to strengthen China&#x2019;s management of ecosystems affected by climate change. The project will benefit both biological diversity conservation and climate change adaptation. It is implemented jointly by Nanjing Institute of Environmental Sciences and Norwegian Environment Agency.</narrative>
